    "body": "@srstevenson is right as you used the default config. Refer to https://starship.rs/config/#battery-display to configure it.\r\n\r\nTry adding the following text to your config\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle = \"bold yellow\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nClosed as it is not a bug. But feel free to continue to ask questions here.",
